          "text": "{\"edits\":[{\"path\":\"/scenes/4/variants\",\"value_json\":\"[{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Nia told Mallow, \\\\\\\"Those books are waiting for children who cannot come here.\\\\\\\" Mallow’s boast shrank to a pebble. Then she tucked it in her pocket. \\\\\\\"Perhaps,\\\\\\\" she said, \\\\\\\"the biggest parade is the one that reaches the smallest doorstep.\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"when\\\":[]},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Nia pointed to the waiting books. \\\\\\\"They have somewhere to go.\\\\\\\" Mallow blinked at the stack, then at her cart. Her grandest boast softened into a useful question: \\\\\\\"Can the parade stop long enough for a story?\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"when\\\":[]}]\"}]}",
